<article class="qh__teaser-notification">
  <div class="qh__teaser-notification__excerpt">
    <h4><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">Scam Alert: Scammers Spoofing RIDOH State Phone Numbers</span>
</h4>
    <p>The Department of Health has&nbsp;gotten reports of scammers using Rhode Island State Government Phone numbers. If you receive a call from a RIDOH phone number and you are not sure if it is from our department, please hang up and call us back directly at 401-222-5960. We’re happy to assist you.</p><p>The Office of the Attorney General has great resources to help you identify scams: <a href="https://riag.ri.gov/scams"><strong>https://riag.ri.gov/scams</strong></a></p>
  </div>
</article>


